      "inputTokens": 72,
      "outputTokens": 531,
      "costUsd": 0.004815,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's a way to remember the test. Same count behind every bar. Look behind each value of X, and count the equally likely outcomes there. This only works if those outcomes really are equally likely. If every count is the same, X is uniform. The calendar's dates fail this test, and so do the sums of two dice."
    },
