      "pronunciationText": "The values are two, four, six, up to twenty, which is ten values, so each has probability one tenth. Greater than fifteen means sixteen, eighteen or twenty, three values. So P of X greater than fifteen is three tenths. Three twentieths is wrong. Twenty is the largest value, not the number of values."
