      "inputTokens": 81,
      "outputTokens": 575,
      "costUsd": 0.0052155,
      "pronunciationText": "X can be zero, one or two. Count the sectors behind each value. Remainder zero has two sectors, and remainders one and two have three sectors each. So the probabilities are two eighths, three eighths and three eighths, and X isn't uniform. Saying it's uniform because the spinner is fair is wrong. Fair sectors don't make a fair variable."
